Its pinned model card declares Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/
This model licence is separate from the implementation source licence. The
segmentation exporter converts the raw checkpoint to F32 safetensors and
materialises SincNet filters (modified weight representations). The embedding
exporter preserves 182 F32 tensors and 36 I64 counters in safetensors from raw
embedding SHA256 6f10ff60898a1d185fa22e1d11e0bfa8a92efec811f11bca48cb8cafebefd929.
